<P STYLE="text-align: right; margin: 0"><B>Exhibit 10.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0; text-align: right"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><BR>
FORM OF COMPANY STOCKHOLDER VOTING AGREEMENT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">This Company Stockholder Voting
Agreement, dated as of ________, 2026 (this &ldquo;<U>Agreement</U>&rdquo;), by and between Santersus AG, a Swiss corporation (Aktiengesellschaft)
(&ldquo;<U>Santersus</U>&rdquo;), and the Person set forth on <U>Schedule A</U> hereto (&ldquo;<U>Stockholder</U>&rdquo;). Capitalized
terms used but not defined in this Agreement shall have the respective meanings ascribed to them in the Share Exchange Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>RECITALS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, concurrently herewith,
(i) Xenetic Biosciences, Inc., a Nevada corporation (&ldquo;<U>Company</U>&rdquo;), (ii) Santersus, (iii) the persons listed on Schedule
I thereto (the &ldquo;<U>Sellers</U>&rdquo;), and (iv) Santersus, as representative of the Sellers, are entering into a Share Exchange
Agreement (the &ldquo;<U>Share Exchange Agreement</U>&rdquo;), pursuant to which, among other things, and subject to the terms and conditions
set forth therein, the Sellers will sell, transfer and convey to the Company, and the Company will purchase from the Sellers, in exchange
for shares of Company Common Stock (as defined below), all of the issued and outstanding capital stock of Santersus (the &ldquo;<U>Acquisition</U>&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, as of the date hereof,
Stockholder is the &ldquo;beneficial owner&rdquo; (within the meaning of Rule&nbsp;13d-3 promulgated under the Securities Exchange Act
of 1934, as amended (the &ldquo;<U>Exchange Act</U>&rdquo;)) of Company common stock, $0.001 per share (&ldquo;<U>Company Common Stock</U>&rdquo;)
as set forth on <U>Schedule&nbsp;A</U> hereto (together with any other equity securities of the Company, including all securities exchangeable,
exercisable or convertible into Company Common Stock, and any securities issued or exchanged with respect to Company Common Stock, and
upon any recapitalization, reclassification, merger, consolidation, spin-off, partial or complete liquidation, stock dividend, split-up
or combination of the securities of the Company or upon any other change in the Company&rsquo;s capital structure, in each case whether
now owned or hereafter acquired by Stockholder during the period from and including the date hereof through and including the Termination
Date (as defined below), the &ldquo;<U>Covered Shares</U>&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, as a condition and
material inducement to Santersus&rsquo; willingness to enter into the Share Exchange Agreement and to proceed with the transactions contemplated
thereby, including the Acquisition, Santersus has required Stockholder to enter into this Agreement; and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, Stockholder acknowledges
that Santersus is entering into the Share Exchange Agreement in reliance on the representations, warranties, covenants and other agreements
of Stockholder set forth in this Agreement and would not enter into the Share Exchange Agreement if Stockholder did not enter into this
Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></P>

