<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="display: inline-block; width: 0.5in; float: left; white-space:nowrap">(a)</FONT>
</FONT>Prior to the Termination Date, and except as contemplated hereby, Stockholder shall not directly or indirectly (i)&nbsp;tender
into any tender or exchange offer, (ii)&nbsp;sell (constructively or otherwise), transfer, pledge, hypothecate, grant, encumber, assign
