all of the terms of this Agreement to the same extent as Stockholder (a &ldquo;<U>Joinder</U>&rdquo;), and (Y)&nbsp;such Transfer is effected
no later than three (3) Business Days prior to the record date for any Stockholder Meeting (or any adjournment or postponement thereof)
and does not delay, hinder or impede (1)&nbsp;the timely voting or consent of the Covered Shares in accordance with <U>Section 1</U> or
(2)&nbsp;the consummation of the Acquisition. [Notwithstanding the foregoing, the following shall not violate this <U>Section 6</U>: (i)
